      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "I've had gout for two years now. I have an irregular heartbeat, for nearly five years. I've been reading about it online and it worried me. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know. Epilepsy, for five years. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing.",
